<main class="faq-page">
  <div class="faq-header">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p>Find answers to common questions about Memphis Travel Assistant.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>What is Memphis Travel Assistant?</h3>
      <p>Memphis Travel Assistant is a free web app that helps you plan your time in Memphis. You can explore the map, check the weather, discover local attractions, and save your plans all in one place.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Do I need an account to use the app?</h3>
      <p>No — you can browse attractions, check the weather, and explore the map without signing in. However, creating a free account lets you save plans and access personalized features.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I save a location to my planner?</h3>
      <p>Navigate to the Maps page, find a location you like, and click "Add to Planner." You'll need to be signed in to save locations to your planner.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Is the weather information real-time?</h3>
      <p>Yes — the Weather page shows real-time weather in Memphis so you always know what conditions are like outside. If the live data can’t load, it will show the most recent saved weather instead.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I contact support?</h3>
      <p>You can reach us at <a href="mailto:support@memphistravel.com">support@memphistravel.com</a> and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>